<p class="small text-body-secondary mb-3">Link kingdom bank data to Denarius app <strong>{{ connect.config.appId }}</strong> through SimpleFIN.</p>
<ol class="small text-body-secondary mb-3">
    <li>Keep this Denarius tab open (you already clicked Add bank).</li>
    <li>In SimpleFIN, sign in via <strong>Go to my account</strong> if you are not already.</li>
    <li>Open the connection link below and follow SimpleFIN until you have a <strong>setup token</strong> (long text).</li>
    <li>Paste that token on <a href="/bank/simplefin/return">Finish SimpleFIN connection</a>.</li>
</ol>
<p class="small text-body-secondary mb-2">Connection link (open while signed in to SimpleFIN):</p>
<p class="mb-3"><a class="small text-break" href="{{ connect.config.bridgeUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ connect.config.bridgeUrl }}</a></p>
<button type="button" id="simplefin-connect" class="btn btn-primary">Open SimpleFIN connection link</button>
<script>
document.getElementById('simplefin-connect').addEventListener('click', function () {
    window.open({{ connect.config.bridgeUrl|json_encode|raw }}, '_blank', 'noopener,noreferrer');
});
</script>
